  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Magnolia by the Sea in NatureWalk | 4BR Retreat w/ Golf Cart! <br><br>A picture perfect 30A getaway! Nestled in the heart of NatureWalk, we present ~ Magnolia by the Sea! A 4 bedroom, 3.5-bath home featuring amazing amenities (think golf cart + bikes!) access to 2 pools (seasonally heated too!) and easy beach access via the Lily Lane beach Trail. The home sleeps 12 with both a first floor and second floor king bed en suite. <br><br>✨Features ~ <br>- 6 passenger golf cart, beach access is a quick ride away! <br>- 4 bikes. Great for cruising into Seaside or taking the trail to the beach. <br>- Spacious open-concept living + dining area with coastal décor<br>- Fully equipped kitchen with Keurig & drip coffee maker + complimentary coffee. <br>- Large dining space—perfect for family meals & entertaining. Seating for 10, plus additional stools at the kitchen island. <br>- Upstairs living space with additional TV and comfy seating<br>- Outdoor porch space to unwind after a day at the beach. Daybed porch swings, lounge chairs, and more! <br>- Family friendly: Pack n Play, highchair, and baby gate available for your little one. <br>- Grill is featured off the front porch: burgers and dogs, perfect cap to a beach day. <br>- First Floor: Primary en suite, living room, dining room, kitchen, laundry, and porch access <br>- Second Floor: Additional living room, Primary en suite, guest bedroom, and kids bunk room, <br><br>🏠It's a beautiful day in the neighborhood ~ NatureWalk at Seagrove<br>- Guest only access to \"The Gathering Place\". Zero entry pool, heated lap pool (seasonally Oct - Apr), splash pool for littles, hot tub, loungers, gas grills, fire pit, kitchenette, showers, restrooms, and more! <br>- Pickleball and Tennis Courts <br>- Playground <br>- Hammocks<br>- Walking trails around Point Washington State Forest <br>- 8 min drive to Seaside or quick bike or golf cart ride. <br>- Direct access to Lilly Lane bike and walking trail; leading you to San Jaun Ave Beach Access <br>- If cruising on the golf cart is more your style, you're just 10 min away from Santa Clara Access.<br><br>🛏️ For Rest ~ <br>- Primary Suite (1st Floor): King bed, en suite bathroom with dual vanities, walk in shower, and soaking tub. <br>- Guest Bedroom (2nd Floor): Queen bed with shared hallway full bath. <br>- Primary Suite (2nd Floor): King bed, en suite bathroom with double vanity, walk-in shower and soaking tub. Bonus here: balcony access and a porch swing! <br>- Bunk Room: (2nd Floor): 2 Twin bunk beds. Sleeps 4 total. <br>- 2nd Floor Living Area: Queen sleeper sofa <br><br>✅The Essentials ~ <br>- Premium Goods; Full size Public Goods lotion, hand soap, shampoo, conditioner, and body wash are stocked in every bathroom & kitchen <br>- Starter kit for everything you'll need: paper towels, toilet paper, linens, towels, dish soap, laundry pods, etc. <br>- Leave your beach gear at home, we've got you covered– we provide towels, beach chairs, umbrella, and sand toys. <br>- Washer + Dryer included on first floor. <br>- Outdoor shower for rinsing off after a long beach day <br><br>⛱️Minutes to the Shore ~ <br>- The Lilly Lane beach trail leads you right to the San Juan Beach access point – it's a 10-15 min walk down the trail to San Juan Ave. <br>- Santa Clara Regional Access point. 10 min golf cart ride! Offers parking, lifeguards, and restrooms. You can also rent chairs, umbrellas, bonfires, etc.. here. <br>- Grayton Dunes – this one is a 15 min ride. Beautiful dunes and entry point, plus it's super scenic! There is parking and lifeguards available here as well. <br><br>To note: <br>- Parking: 2 spots in the driveway and street parking also available.<br>- This home requires a minimum stay of 6 nights due to HOA requirements. <br>- Minimum age to rent the home is 25.<br>- We love our furry friends, and they need a vacation too! We allow 1 dog that is under 30 lbs and non- shedding. If your pup fits that criteria, we'd love for you to bring them along. A one-time, non-refundable pet fee of $150 will be added to your reservation. Thank you for understanding!<br>- Vacation disruptions can be a bummer. While it doesn't happen often, you may experience issues with Wi-Fi or construction on 30A. We are not responsible for any disruptions to the Wi-Fi service or any construction that may affect your experience. Please note that such occurrences are beyond our control, and we appreciate your understanding and patience in these matters. <br><br>STR-222136",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
